<https://w3id.org/pnv#prefix> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A Prefix is a noble or honorific title prefixing a name, e.g. \"Prof. dr.\" or \"Jhr.\""^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/pnv#surname> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/pnv#PersonName> .
