<https://w3id.org/pnv#literalName> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Literal name designates a full personal name. This property may only be left blank if a person's name was unknown or if a person was unnamed (e.g. a child that died shortly after being born), in which cases the property pnv:nameSpecification should state \"unknown\" or \"unnamed\"."@en .
